✅ **Key Interview Line:**  
“In streaming pipelines, errors can occur at multiple layers — network, schema, downstream services, scaling, data quality, and monitoring. Each has specific resolution strategies like retries, schema evolution, autoscaling, deduplication, and alerting. Designing with fault tolerance ensures resilience at scale.”

So the choice depends on whether the business values low latency or long-term storage.”

